  "description": "After narrowly escaping the threat of the vampires, the werewolf boys try to settle down in a seaside village. They hope for a peaceful school life but instead meet Khan, a boy who has been branded as a devil and is bullied because of it. There's been a death in this quiet village, and with Khan's deep-rooted secret, the boys may be faced with yet another danger... \n\n(Source: WEBTOON) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
